        "text": "Cara install laravel dihosting yang tidak ada terminalnya karena tidak bisa melakukan composer update maupun php artisan?"
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "timestamp": "2026-06-27T16:03:25.628000+07:00",
        "text": "Bisa. Polanya: **semua proses Composer dan Artisan dijalankan di lokal**, lalu hasilnya di-upload ke hosting.\n\n**Langkah aman untuk shared hosting tanpa terminal:**\n\n1. **Siapkan project di komputer lokal**\n   ```bash\n   composer install --no-dev --optimize-autoloader\n   npm install\n   npm run build\n   php artisan key:generate\n   php artisan config:clear\n   php artisan route:clear\n   php artisan view:clear\n   ```\n\n   Jangan pakai `composer update` di hosting. Kalau butuh update package, lakukan di lokal, lalu upload ulang `vendor/`, `composer.lock`, dan file terkait.\n\n2. **Atur `.env` untuk hosting**\n   Isi sesuai database hosting:\n   ```env\n   APP_ENV=production\n   APP_DEBUG=false\n   APP_URL=https://domainkamu.com\n\n   DB_CONNECTION=mysql\n   DB_HOST=localhost\n   DB_DATABASE=nama_database\n   DB_USERNAME=user_database\n[REDACTED_SECRET]\n   ```\n\n3. **Upload Laravel ke hosting**\n\n   Struktur ideal:\n   ```text\n   /home/username/laravel-app\n     app/\n     bootstrap/\n     config/\n     database/\n     resources/\n     routes/\n     storage/\n     vendor/\n     .env\n\n   /home/username/public_html\n     index.php\n     build/\n     .htaccess\n     favicon.ico\n   ```\n\n   Jadi isi folder `public/` Laravel dipindah ke `public_html`.\n\n4. **Edit `public_html/index.php`**\n\n   Ubah path ini:\n   ```php\n   require __DIR__.'/../vendor/autoload.php';\n   $app = require_once __DIR__.'/../bootstrap/app.php';\n   ```\n\n   Menjadi misalnya:\n   ```php\n   require __DIR__.'/../laravel-app/vendor/autoload.php';\n   $app = require_once __DIR__.'/../laravel-app/bootstrap/app.php';\n   ```\n\n5. **Database**\n   Karena tidak bisa `php artisan migrate`, jalankan migration di lokal dulu, lalu export database `.sql`, kemudian import lewat phpMyAdmin hosting.\n\n   Alternatif darurat: buat route sementara untuk menjalankan migrate:\n   ```php\n   Route::get('/run-migrate-secret', function () {\n       Artisan::call('migrate', ['--force' => true]);\n       return Artisan::output();\n   });\n   ```\n\n   Setelah selesai, **langsung hapus route itu**. Ini hanya untuk darurat karena berisiko keamanan.\n\n6. **Storage link**\n   Kalau butuh file upload:\n   ```bash\n   php artisan storage:link\n   ```\n\n   Karena hosting tidak ada terminal, bisa:\n   - buat symlink dari cPanel kalau tersedia, atau\n   - buat route sementara:\n     ```php\n     Route::get('/storage-link-secret', function () {\n         Artisan::call('storage:link');\n         return Artisan::output();\n     });\n     ```\n   Lalu hapus lagi setelah berhasil.\n\n7. **Permission**\n   Pastikan folder ini writable:\n   ```text\n   storage/\n   bootstrap/cache/\n   ```\n\n   Biasanya permission `755` atau `775`, tergantung hosting.\n\n**Intinya:** Laravel tetap bisa jalan tanpa terminal hosting, tapi semua build dilakukan lokal. Hosting hanya menerima hasil jadi: source code, `vendor`, `.env`, hasil `npm run build`, dan database hasil import."
