        "text": "PLEASE IMPLEMENT THIS PLAN:\n# Manage Event + Event Registration Booking MVP\n\n## Ringkasan\n\nBangun dalam dua spec berurutan:\n\n1. **Manage Event Content** — modul Event terisolasi dari Article, kategori/status sendiri, occurrence/session, admin CRUD, dan authenticated list/detail.\n2. **Event Registration Booking MVP** — registrasi peserta per occurrence dengan kapasitas, waitlist FIFO, cancel, attendance, notifikasi, dan reminder.\n\nArticle serta PRD Meeting Room/Asset Booking tetap tidak diubah.\n\n## Perubahan Utama\n\n- Tabel baru melalui `database/migrations` aktif:\n  `events`, `event_categories`, `event_occurrences`, `event_booking_settings`, dan `event_registrations`.\n- Event menyimpan title, URI unik, content, tags, thumbnail, kategori, publication status, dan visibility public/private.\n- Occurrence menyimpan jadwal, timezone, lokasi teks/online URL, lifecycle, registration window, dan capacity wajib.\n- Admin UI mengikuti pola Manage Article: Blade + Vue, pagination/filter, category panel, responsive table, thumbnail pipeline path `events`, serta occurrence nested dengan endpoint terpisah.\n- Menu legacy `Manage Event` dipertahankan tetapi URL dinormalisasi; `Layout` ditunda/disembunyikan.\n- Permission memakai module `manage_event` dengan pola CRUD generik.\n- Attendee route memakai `/event`, hanya untuk user login; register/cancel masuk Spec 2.\n- Registration unik per account/occurrence, boleh re-register setelah cancel, auto-confirm sampai penuh, lalu waitlist FIFO dan promosi otomatis secara atomik.\n- Reminder dan cancel cutoff default 24 jam, dapat dioverride per event. Notifikasi peserta dan admin dikirim melalui notification center serta email after-commit; data peserta tidak dikirim ke public Reverb channel.\n\n## Test Plan\n\n- Schema, model relation, CRUD, kategori, slug, thumbnail, permission, route, occurrence validation, publication/visibility.\n- Registration: capacity, waitlist, FIFO promotion, concurrent requests, duplicate prevention, re-register, cancel cutoff, occurrence cancellation, attendance/no-show, schedule changes, reminder idempotency, email/queue failure isolation.\n- PHP lint, focused Laravel feature tests, `node --check`, Node static/runtime tests, route inspection terfokus, dan browser QA responsive dengan hard reload serta console/network evidence.\n- Regression memastikan Manage Article tetap tidak berubah.\n\n## Asumsi dan Status\n\n- Tidak ada guest registration, room/asset booking, payment, recurrence generator, master venue, atau Layout Builder.\n- Migration baru memakai `database/migrations`, bukan `database/migrations_new`.\n- Artefak lanjutan yang akan dibuat saat eksekusi:\n  `docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-24-manage-event-content-design.md`,\n  `docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-24-event-registration-booking-design.md`,\n  serta dua implementation plan terkait.\n- Turn ini planning-only: tidak ada source yang diubah, backup dibuat, test dijalankan, atau Graphify diperbarui. Graphify existing dipakai melalui query/explain/path Manage Article.\n- Defect lama `App\\Http\\Controllers\\Web\\Articles\\Article_Controller` tetap di luar scope; route baru diverifikasi secara terfokus."
