leFrontendController.php:53](D:/Laragon/www/laravel-13-phoenix/app/Http/Controllers/Web/Article/ArticleFrontendController.php:53)\n\n`renderDetail()` mengambil detail template aktif, neighbors, dan detail options:\n\n[ArticleFrontendController.php:155](D:/Laragon/www/laravel-13-phoenix/app/Http/Controllers/Web/Article/ArticleFrontendController.php:155)\n\nWrapper detail memasukkan `$detailView` dan meneruskan `previousArticle` serta `nextArticle`:\n\n[detail.blade.php:10](D:/Laragon/www/laravel-13-phoenix/resources/views/article/detail.blade.php:10)\n\nTiga detail renderer saat ini memang sudah ada:\n\n- [focused-reader.blade.php](D:/Laragon/www/laravel-13-phoenix/resources/views/article/templates/detail/focused-reader.blade.php)\n- [editorial-feature.blade.php](D:/Laragon/www/laravel-13-phoenix/resources/views/article/templates/detail/editorial-feature.blade.php)\n- [knowledge-toc.blade.php](D:/Laragon/www/laravel-13-phoenix/resources/views/article/templates/detail/knowledge-toc.blade.php)\n\nDetail tidak memakai Vue archive runtime karena detail saat ini merupakan Blade-rendered reading surface. Itu bukan indikasi detail belum di-update. Interaksi yang dibutuhkan di detail—back link, content, TOC anchor, dan previous/next navigation—sudah berada di Blade renderer.\n\n## Template Options yang sudah selesai\n\nNormalizer utama ada di:\n\n[ArticleTemplateOptions.php](D:/Laragon/www/laravel-13-phoenix/app/Support/Article/ArticleTemplateOptions.php)\n\nArchive options sekarang mencakup:\n\n- header eyebrow/title/description;\n- search dan category toolbar;\n- posisi left/center/right;\n- responsive grid columns;\n- thumbnail background atau asset mode;\n- `cover`/`contain`;\n- thumbnail frame;\n- pagination visibility;\n- pagination position;\n- pagination frame;\n- pagination padding/margin;\n- article title tag H1–H6;\n- shell padding/margin/frame.\n\nDetail options saat ini mencakup:\n\n- dynamic/custom eyebrow;\n- dynamic/custom description;\n- enable/disable detai